Objectives :-

1. To implement a General Tree data structure using C++.
2. To represent family relationships through parent-child connections.
3. To search for a family member and identify their ancestors.
4. To display all descendants of a selected family member.
5. To count family members at each generation level using level-order traversal.
6. To understand recursion and Breadth-First Search (BFS) in tree operations.
7. To develop a menu-driven application for managing a family hierarchy.
